  "description": "Bambieta, the chancellor who was stabbed and murdered by the sword of Lusley—the very monarch she raised to the throne. At the threshold of death, she enters into a contract with mysterious monsters and regresses 10 years into the past. The contract has only one condition: place Nenya, an ordinary girl, upon the throne of the Karia Empire. However, if Nenya dies, Bambieta is forced to regress to the past once again.\nSource: MU",
